layout: base.njk
permalink: /ethics/
pageTitle: "OpenShore ethical boundaries: enforced by default"
pageDescription: "OpenShore enforces a narrow set of ethical boundaries on every model call, local and cloud, with no setting that turns them off. What is blocked, what is gated behind consent, what is deliberately left alone, and the limits we will not pretend away."
---

